This project showcases interactive dashboards built using Power BI, Tableau, and SQL with the AdventureWorks dataset. 
The goal is to transform raw business data into actionable insights for decision‑makers.

🔑 Key Features
Data Preparation with SQL: Complex joins, aggregations, and views created to support analytics.

Power BI Dashboards: Dynamic slicers, page navigation, and KPI cards for sales, product, and customer insights.

Tableau Visualizations: Interactive charts with parameter controls, forecasting, and trend analysis.
